          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On July 8, 1978, around 11:40 PM, a witness observed the north-south passage of a elongated flying object. Located at an estimated altitude of 1000 to 2000 meters by the witness, it consisted of a set of four non-glowing red balls. No noise was heard during the brief observation. No other testimony was collected on this case, for which we lack information.",
